### 1. Add dayjs Import & the Date Helper Function
At the very top of your file, add the dayjs import:
```javascript
import dayjs from "dayjs";

```
Then, right below your calculateTimeElapsed function (around line 224), add the helper function:
```javascript
const formatDateTime = (dateVal) => {
  if (!dateVal) return "N/A";
  return dayjs(dateVal).format("DD MMM YYYY, hh:mm a").toLowerCase();
};

```
